            <profile id="f091-382e-7dae-e6ba" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour and a shield. May have heavy armour (+4 pts), throwing or thrusting spear (+2 pts), and either javelins (+2 pts) or a bow (+3 pts). If on foot, he may have a double-handed weapon (+2 pts), an additional hand weapon (+3 pts) or a Dane Axe (+2 pts). May ride a warhorse (+16 pts). Army General Options: if the total army is less than 2,000 pts, a Tysiatski may be upgraded to Army General (+25 pts). (Byzantium p.88)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="f15b-def3-d5dd-9bca" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
