              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon. May have a shield (+2 pts) or a buckler (+1 pt), thrusting spear (+2 pts) and either javelins (+1 pt) or a bow (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. Militia on horses were generally of a poorer quality than the allied tribes. (Byzantium p.88)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="bf5a-3ca8-4750-f880" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
