              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with farm implements (treat as a hand weapon) and a shield. May have thrusting spear (+1 pt). Special Rules: Levies. May not include a Musician or Standard Bearer. The Smerd became rare in the late 12th Century and were only used in emergencies. Not available to Mongol Invasion armies. (Byzantium p.89)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="7169-3692-3be3-d830" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
