              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bow and a hand weapon. May exchange their bows for javelins and shields (free). Skirmishers. Levies. At least as many Northern Tribal Warrior allies (Voi) as Slavic skirmishers must be chosen (not enforced). The Slavic entry represents peasant hunters or tribal warrior (Voi) allies. (Byzantium p.89)</characteristic>
